      "created_at": "2017-11-25T20:57:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Trajector: Legacy's theme is a bonus track in the Shattered Timelines OST, <a href=\"https://youtu.be/oHHOgbUuwIY?t=6292\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Tachyon's theme is here</a>, <a href=\"https://youtu.be/utQaMn_kyAw?t=5215\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Mr. Fixer's theme is here</a>, and IIRC that's all the ones we've heard anything of so far. Although I guess also Rogue o' the North on the Lazer Ryderz OST is the closest we'll get to a KNYFE theme, too.</p>",
